  "reading": {
    "id": "n5.l22.r01",
    "lessonId": "n5.l22",
    "title": "土曜日の日記 (Saturday Diary in Plain Form)",
    "level": "N5",
    "text": "今日は土曜日だ。朝九時に起きて、朝ごはんを食べた。天気がとても良かったから、友達のケンと一緒に渋谷へ行った。駅前のカフェでコーヒーを飲みながら、日本語の勉強や将来の夢についていろいろ話した。それから、本屋へ行って面白い漫画を買った。夜は家でカレーを作って食べた。美味しかった。明日も休みだから、ゆっくり休むつもりだ。",
    "kanaText": "きょうはどようびだ。あさくじにおきて、あさごはんをたべた。てんきがとてもよかったから、ともだちのけんといっしょにしぶやへいった。えきまえのかふぇでこーひーをのみながら、にほんごのべんきょうやしょうらいのゆめについていろいろはなした。それから、ほんやへいっておもしろいまんがをかった。よるはいえでかれーをつくってたべた。おいしかった。あしたもやすみだから、ゆっくりやすむつもりだ。",
    "translation": "Today is Saturday. I woke up at 9:00 AM and ate breakfast. Because the weather was very nice, I went to Shibuya with my friend Ken. While drinking coffee at a cafe in front of the station, we talked about many things, including Japanese studies and future dreams. After that, we went to a bookstore and bought interesting manga. In the evening, I made curry at home and ate it. It was delicious. Tomorrow is also a day off, so I plan to rest comfortably.",
    "questionIds": [
      "n5.l22.q021",
      "n5.l22.q022",
      "n5.l22.q023",
      "n5.l22.q024",
      "n5.l22.q025"
    ],
    "difficulty": 1,
    "glossary": [],
    "prov": {
      "source": "Nihongo N2 Master Editorial Team (Native Review)",
      "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
      "status": "reviewed",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-01T00:00:00Z",
      "rev": 2
    },
    "titleMy": "土曜日の日記 (Saturday Diary in Plain Form) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "titleMyanmar": "土曜日の日記 (Saturday Diary in Plain Form) (ဖတ်ရှုခြင်း)",
    "translationMy": "Today is Saturday. I woke up at 9:00 AM and ate breakfast. Because the weather was very nice, I went to Shibuya with my friend Ken. While drinking coffee at a cafe in front of the station, we talked about many things, including Japanese studies and future dreams. After that, we went to a bookstore and bought interesting manga. In the evening, I made curry at home and ate it. It was delicious. Tomorrow is also a day off, so I plan to rest comfortably."
